  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 26051,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah... \r\nThe \"Epitaph Road\" enshrines \r\nfallen heroes who served the Royal Family. \r\nIt is said they awaken in times of crisis\r\nto lend their power...",
        "Jp" : "あの――《英霊眠りし道》には\r\n王家に尽くした英霊が祀られているんです\r\nその英霊たちは、王家の危機に目覚めて\r\n力を貸してくれるんだとか――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 630924,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "There are many legends—but the most famous\r\nspeaks of a mysterious stone tablet within.\r\nOne must overcome the trials written upon it.",
        "Jp" : "色んな伝承がありますけど――\r\n一番有名なのは、中には不思議な石版があって\r\nそこに書かれた試練を乗り越えないと\r\nいけないっていう話ですね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 713373,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Not only that—further in, there are statues\r\nof the heroic spirits. Some say you must\r\ntouch them as well.",
        "Jp" : "それだけじゃなく――\r\nさらに奥には英霊の石像があって\r\nそれを触らないといけないっていう\r\n続きもあったりしますけど"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 630925,
      "MsgType" : 1,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 26052,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What is the Trial of the Tablet?",
        "Jp" : "石版の試練とは？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 630926,
      "MsgType" : 2,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 26053,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What is the Heroic Spirit Statue?",
        "Jp" : "英霊の石像とは？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 630927,
      "MsgType" : 2,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
